&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;eelhe-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;eelhe-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Write clean, maintainable Java code while adhering to industry best practices. Participate in code reviews to uphold quality standards and troubleshoot issues within existing software solutions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;8ung4&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;eelhe-0-0&quot;&gt;
