&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re hiring an Engineering Manager to lead the Semantic Layer team in Bengaluru. You&#39;ll own the health, delivery, and growth of the team behind MetricFlow — building and coaching a group of engineers, setting technical direction in partnership with your leads, and ensuring one of the most important projects in the modern data stack keeps shipping with quality and momentum.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a hands-on leadership role. You&#39;ll spend most of your time growing people, running a healthy delivery process, and shaping strategy — but you&#39;ll stay close enough to the code and the architecture to make sound technical calls and earn the trust of a senior engineering team. You&#39;ll also be the steward of a public, community-facing open-source project, balancing the needs of internal roadmap and external contributors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
